---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import InfoPage from "@components/InfoPage.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | NepalRanks"
  description="NepalRanks terms of service: data status, voting rules, acceptable use, moderation and the no-warranty disclaimer."
>
  <InfoPage eyebrow="Legal">
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p>Last updated: 31 October 2026.</p>

    <h2>1. What this site is</h2>
    <p>
      NepalRanks publishes community-voted rankings of Nepali services, places and brands.
      Until a ranking has real community activity, its figures may be <strong>seeded sample
      content</strong>; pages always show raw up/down/net numbers so you can judge the evidence.
      Do not rely on any single ranking for a financial, study, travel or health decision.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Voting rules (binding)</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>One vote per ranking, up to 3 votes across the site</strong>, rolling 24 hours; one vote per item (switching replaces and uses no extra slot).</li>
      <li>Voting and commenting require a Google account; your identity is verified server-side. Circumventing the limits with multiple accounts is abuse, accounts can be restricted (banned) and manipulated votes are removed.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Comments</h2>
    <p>
      You are responsible for what you post. No defamation, harassment, private information or
      spam. Comments are published with a display name you choose, don’t post names of third
      parties without consent.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Moderation</h2>
    <p>
      Moderators can hide comments, remove manipulated votes and, once accounts arrive, ban
      users from voting and commenting. Moderators <strong>cannot edit ranking positions</strong>:
      order is computed from scores only.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Trademarks and named institutions</h2>
    <p>
      Institution names (banks, universities, providers, cities) belong to their owners and appear
      as community-discussion subjects. Nothing here is sponsored by, affiliated with or endorsed
      by any named organisation unless explicitly stated on the page.
    </p>

    <h2>6. No warranty; no liability</h2>
    <p>
      The service is provided “as is”. To the extent permitted by law, the operators of NepalRanks
      are not liable for decisions taken based on the content of this site.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Data</h2>
    <p>
      Personal-data handling is described in the <a href="privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
      Material changes (accounts, ads) will be announced here before they switch on.
    </p>
  </InfoPage>
</BaseLayout>
